      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n  @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.48.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css');\n</style>\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50 font-[Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif] text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n    <div class=\"border-b border-emerald-100 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-900\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"status banner text\">\n        IN USE · MOBILE SIN RESULTADOS\n    </div>\n    <header class=\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"site header\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-[68px] max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"header content container\">\n            <a aria-label=\"FarmaciaCerca, inicio\" class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand identity link\" href=\"#\">\n                <span class=\"flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-600 text-white shadow-sm shadow-sky-900/15\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo icon container\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[28px] font-light leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo symbol\">\n                        +\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name and descriptor group\">\n                    <span class=\"block text-sm font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                        FarmaciaCerca\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-0.5 block max-w-[132px] text-[10px] leading-3 font-medium text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"data source notice\">\n                        Precio de referencia · Ministerio de Salud\n                    </span>\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"header controls container\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Cambiar tema\" class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"theme toggle button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-moon text-base\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"moon icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Usar mi ubicación\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"location search button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"location pin icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"location button label\">\n                        Ubicación\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-9 pt-7\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"main page content\">\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"search-title\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"search section\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-[27px] font-extrabold leading-[1.13] tracking-tight text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"search section headline\" id=\"search-title\">\n                Buscá por principio activo o nombre comercial\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"search section description\">\n                Compará precios de referencia entre laboratorios para una misma presentación.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-5 flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-1.5 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"search input container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-search ml-2 shrink-0 text-lg text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"search icon\">\n                </i>\n                <label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"hidden search input label\" for=\"medicine-search\">\n                    Buscar por principio activo o nombre comercial\n                </label>\n                <input class=\"h-11 min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-1 text-sm text-slate-900 outline-none placeholder:text-slate-400\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"search input field\" data-reason=\"value dynamically set and managed by search script\" id=\"medicine-search\" placeholder=\"Ej. ibuprofeno, paracetamol\" type=\"search\" value=\"xyzqqq\"/>\n                <button aria-label=\"Limpiar búsqueda\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4\" data-name=\"clear search button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-x text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"clear icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"clear button text\">\n                        Limpiar\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-2.5 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4\" data-name=\"search disclaimer text\">\n                El precio se compara entre laboratorios de una misma presentación.\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-5\" data-name=\"catalog size information\">\n                <strong class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-5-1\" data-name=\"catalog size label\">\n                    Catálogo parcial\n                </strong>\n                · 1.923 productos\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"results-title\" class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"results section\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-slate-200 pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"results header container\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"results status headline\" data-reason=\"text updated based on search query\" id=\"results-title\">\n                    Sin resultados para “xyzqqq”\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"no results feedback container\" role=\"status\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"no results message\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"no results title\">\n                        No encontramos coincidencias\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"no results suggestion\">\n                        Probá con el principio activo o con el nombre comercial. El catálogo disponible es parcial.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"no results clear button\">\n                    Limpiar búsqueda\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <section aria-label=\"Directorio de farmacias\" class=\"mt-6 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"pharmacy directory section\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3.5 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"location prompt container\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-lg text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"location pin icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"location prompt message\">\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"location status title\">\n                            Ubicación desactivada\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"location status description\">\n                            Activá tu ubicación para saber qué farmacia te queda más cerca.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <section aria-labelledby=\"pharmacies-title\" class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"pharmacies in region section\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-950\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacies headline\" id=\"pharmacies-title\">\n                        Farmacias registradas en CABA\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"pharmacies disclaimer\">\n                        El registro es independiente de la búsqueda; no informa precio ni stock. Llamá para consultar antes de ir.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"pharmacy filter container\">\n                        <label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"filter label\" for=\"pharmacy-filter\">\n                            Filtrar farmacias\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"h-11 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 text-sm text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-500\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"filter input field\" data-reason=\"value managed by filter script\" id=\"pharmacy-filter\" placeholder=\"Barrio, comuna o nombre\" type=\"search\"/>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"filter count indicator\" data-reason=\"count updated by filter script\">\n                            1.240 de 1.240\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"pharmacy list\">\n                        <li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy item\">\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy details\">\n                                <h3 class=\"break-words text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name\">\n                                    Farmacia (Cordoba Av. 2060)\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 break-words text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address\">\n                                    Cordoba Av. 2060\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy region info\">\n                                        · Balvanera · Comuna 3\n                                    </span>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy actions\">\n                                <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"open route button\" href=\"#\">\n                                    Abrir ruta\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy item\">\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy details\">\n                                <h3 class=\"break-words text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name\">\n                                    Farmacia (Cordoba Av. 3200)\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 break-words text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address\">\n                                    Cordoba Av. 3200\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy region info\">\n                                        · Balvanera · Comuna 3\n                                    </span>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy actions\">\n                                <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"open route button\" href=\"#\">\n                                    Abrir ruta\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"pharmacy item\">\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy details\">\n                                <h3 class=\"break-words text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name\">\n                                    Farmacia (Entre Rios Av. 1686)\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 break-words text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address\">\n                                    Entre Rios Av. 1686\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy region info\">\n                                        · Constitución · Comuna 1\n                                    </span>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy actions\">\n                                <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"open route button\" href=\"#\">\n                                    Abrir ruta\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"pharmacy item\">\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy details\">\n                                <h3 class=\"break-words text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-1-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy name\">\n                                    Farmacia (Montes De Oca, Manuel Av. 1405)\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 break-words text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-1-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy address\">\n                                    Montes De Oca, Manuel Av. 1405\n                                    <span class=\"text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"pharmacy region info\">\n                                        · Barracas · Comuna 4\n                                    </span>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"pharmacy actions\">\n                                <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"open route button\" href=\"#\">\n                                    Abrir ruta\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <button class=\"mt-3 inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-sky-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"load more pharmacies button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down text-base\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"chevron icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Ver las 1.240 farmacias\n                    </button>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"pharmacy list disclaimer\">\n                        Sin ubicación activada, la lista está en orden alfabético.\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"sources-title\" class=\"mt-8 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"sources and limitations section\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"section header\" id=\"sources-title\">\n                    Fuentes y limitaciones\n                </h2>\n                <div class=\"mt-3 space-y-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"info list\">\n                    <p class=\"text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"source note\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Precios:\n                        </strong>\n                        referencia CNPM · catálogo parcial basado en una semilla PAMI.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm leading-5 text-slate-600\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"source note\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"note label\">\n                            Farmacias:\n                        </strong>\n                        registro de CABA independiente; no informa precio ni stock.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 px-3.5 py-3 text-sm leading-5 text-amber-950\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"warning callout\">\n                    Confirmá precio y disponibilidad directamente con la farmacia. La consulta de referencia no informa precios de sucursales. No es consejo médico.\n                </p>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-4 py-5 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"footer\">\n        <p data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"copyright version text\">\n            FarmaciaCerca · Versión alpha\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer\">\n            No es consejo médico. Confirmá precio y disponibilidad con la farmacia.\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n    <aside aria-label=\"Nota de pruebas para desarrollo\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-5 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"qa dev note aside\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 px-3.5 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"qa note box\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"qa note content\">\n                <span class=\"flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-violet-100 text-violet-800\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"qa icon container\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-terminal-2 text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"terminal icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"qa note body\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wide text-violet-900\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"qa title\">\n                        QA · npm run test:layout\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-violet-950\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"qa description\">\n                        Sin coincidencias: se ocultan ambas listas de resultados mientras el directorio permanece visible.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] leading-4 text-violet-800\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"qa footer\">\n                        Nota de desarrollo · fuera de la interfaz del producto\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-02T23:39:40.336219+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-02T23:40:00.493413+00:00",
